api_contract_snippet:
POST /v1/rollout/proxy/initiate
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <ephemeral-token>; X-Rollout-Idempotency-Key: <uuid-v4>
Body: { "target_model": "gpt-xt-7b", "experiment": "canary-2026-03-01", "initial_weight": 0.05, "monitoring": { "metrics": ["latency_p95", "error_rate"], "predicates": [{"metric": "latency_p95", "op": ">", "threshold": 1.25, "window_seconds": 300}], "auto_rollback": true } }
Response: 200 { "proxy_run_id": "r-1234", "status": "initiated" }

Idempotency: X-Rollout-Idempotency-Key de-duplicates client retries. Server returns 409 if key conflicts with incompatible payload.

Permissions: ephemeral tokens obtained from POST /v1/rollout/token-exchange with native session token and scope param (preview|manage) and TTL=10m by default.
